0_AQQHsx7FwmWpr-eWqSZTOfVP9IHVoyPta1gzVNJ8XYiX4g&oe=6B0867DF"}, "display_name": "Plug Escape\uff1aFree Circuit Room VR", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Multiplayer", "Adventure", "Escape"], "long_description": "# WHOA! Dudes and Dudettes, ready to get AMPED UP with your crew?\n\nTeam up with friends in the **wacky multiplayer world of Plug Escape** and become a team of energetic plug buddies facing a **BIG problem!** This is the hilarious **co-op VR game** you've been waiting for!\n\nOur little heroes, let's call 'em the '**Spark Squad**' (or your own awesome team name!), were just chilling, minding their own electrifying business, when **BAM! Disaster strikes!** All the super-important batteries they need to power up have scattered themselves around this totally normal-looking (but secretly CRAZY active) room. And guess what? They need **YOU and YOUR FRIENDS** to **work together, strategize,** and get 'em all back in this **fun VR adventure!**\n\nCan your squad find all the batteries before you all short out?\n\n**Grab your headsets, rally your friends, charge up your teamwork,** and get ready for a **shockingly good time** in this **unique VR puzzle adventure.** This isn't just another escape room game; it's an **electrifying co-op journey** that'll have your whole crew **buzzing and laughing** all the way to the (imaginary) power outlet!\n\n**Unite your plug powers!**\n**Become the ultimate battery-collecting champions!**\n\nLet the co-op battery hunt begin in Plug Escape \u2013 one of the **most fun VR games to play with friends!**", "short_description": "Team up in VR! Find batteries as funny plug pals in a wacky co-op puzzle adventure. Don't short out!"}]}, "developer_name": "Storay Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME"